19-\title{A Vertex-Gap Obstruction for Low-Degree Strip Pairs\\ in the Plane Jacobian Conjecture}
20-\author{Dan Clemens Posch\thanks{Email: \texttt{dc@dcpos.ch}. This work was produced in close collaboration with Claude (Fable, an AI system by Anthropic), which developed much of the mathematics and all of the software under the author's direction and review. The author takes responsibility for every claim. The division of labor and the adversarial verification process are described in Section \ref{sec:computation}.}}
